How to Use Mutanter

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Handler:
It creates an object that can connect, disconnect, replaceModuleAttr, revert and StoreChangesLog

self.ConLog
self.CloneLog
self.ConnectLog

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
connect:

Handler.connect(Info)
Handler.disconnect(Info)

Info = {"MyModule1.py" = {"Module2.py", "Calculator.py"}} for example

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HandleAttachment:

Handler.ApplyAttr(AttrInfo, Target)
Handler.DeleteAttr(AttrInfo, Target)

if Target exists, the module that will get modified will be cloned and locally attached to the Target
AttrInfo = {"Printer", "def Print(): print("I print something haha")"} for example


Handler.Revert(RevertInfo) then automatically check if any cloned immport is not attached to anything

RevertInfo = {"MyModule.py", {"Import1.py"}}



------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GarbageCollection:

Handler.GarbageCollection()
GarbageCollection what can i say

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
History:

Handler.LogChanges(self.CloneLog, "Copy_Copied.py") for example

then it will upload the data to the data StoreChangesLog

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


You can pick the functions seperately if u want more overall control from modifier and loader for other purpose


------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Transformer Description:
It acts as an container of extend functions of Mutanter  

